      "text": "God hath helped. (1) Third son of Aaron (Ex. 6:23); admitted to priestly office (Ex. 28:1). Eleazar and Ithamar were Aaron’s chief assistants after the death of Nadab and Abihu by fire (Lev. 10:12, 16; see also Num. 20:25–29; Deut. 10:6; Josh. 14:1; 24:33). All the high priests until the Maccabean period were descended from Eleazar, with the exception of those from Eli to Abiathar, inclusive, who belonged to the family of Ithamar.",
